# Ajani, Outland Chaperone: "-2: Ajani deals 4 damage to target tapped creature." The loyalty cost is paid on activation (CR 606.4),
# so when Bot2 answers with Snakeskin Veil, which gives the tapped Fanatic of Rhonas hexproof, the target is illegal as the ability
# tries to resolve (CR 608.2b) and it does nothing: the Fanatic is a 2/5 with no damage, and Ajani is at 2 loyalty regardless.

